{"Title":"An Act enhancing public safety in the town of Stoneham","BillNumber":"H4678","DocketNumber":"HD5106","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MSD1","Name":"Michael S. Day","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MSD1","ResponseDate":"2024-05-13T15:09:31.86"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MSD1","Name":"Michael S. Day","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MSD1","ResponseDate":"2024-05-13T15:09:31.86"},{"Id":"jml0","Name":"Jason M. Lewis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/jml0","ResponseDate":"2024-05-16T13:04:41.65"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"jml0","Name":"Jason M. Lewis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/jml0","ResponseDate":"2024-05-16T13:04:41.637"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4678/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Day of Stoneham and Senator Lewis, a joint petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 4678) of Michael S. Day and Jason M. Lewis (by vote of the town) that town of Stoneham police department be authorized to waive the maximum age requirement for original appointment of police officers in said town.  Public Service.  [Local Approval Received.]","DocumentText":"\tSection 1. Notwithstanding any general or special law to the contrary, the Town of Stoneham Police Department shall be permitted to waive the maximum age requirement for original appointment of police officers in the Town of Stoneham; provided, however, said officer-candidates for appointment meet all other requirements set forth by the Stoneham Police Department for original appointment to the position of police officer.\r\n\tSection 2. The provisions of this act shall take effect immediately upon passage.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}